{"status": {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/Mileson07/status/2101167448448004249", "id": "2101167448448004249", "text": "这几天超级火的 Jev，我发现很多人只是看热闹，不知道怎么参与进去，包括我自己。\n\n所以，我给自己写了一份学习教程，也分享给更多像我一样小白学 Jev 的你，希望你能喜欢 (｡･ω･｡)ﾉ♡ https://x.com/i/article/2101166175178928128", "raw_text": {"text": "这几天超级火的 Jev，我发现很多人只是看热闹，不知道怎么参与进去，包括我自己。\n\n所以，我给自己写了一份学习教程，也分享给更多像我一样小白学 Jev 的你，希望你能喜欢 (｡･ω･｡)ﾉ♡ https://t.co/1IFt8lW5Tc", "display_text_range": [0, 119], "facets": [{"type": "url", "indices": [96, 119], "original": "https://t.co/1IFt8lW5Tc", "replacement": "https://x.com/i/article/2101166175178928128", "display": "x.com/i/article/2101…"}]}, "author": {"screen_name": "Mileson07", "url": "https://x.com/Mileson07", "id": "3624906326", "followers": 3071, "following": 529, "likes": 335, "media_count": 931, "statuses": 2502, "name": "超级峰", "description": "👨‍💻Ex：10年 toB 产品总监\n📱创造有品味产品（MotiClaw、芝士相机、成片相机）\n💰分享 APP 赚钱、AI 赚钱干货内容\n💰接AI企业培训/顾问，个人AI咨询¥500/小时，企业AI咨询¥2000/小时 ，¥199 进 X 增长教学群，¥99 进 AI 自媒体互卷群＋V：mileson0718", "raw_description": {"text": "👨‍💻Ex：10年 toB 产品总监\n📱创造有品味产品（MotiClaw、芝士相机、成片相机）\n💰分享 APP 赚钱、AI 赚钱干货内容\n💰接AI企业培训/顾问，个人AI咨询¥500/小时，企业AI咨询¥2000/小时 ，¥199 进 X 增长教学群，¥99 进 AI 自媒体互卷群＋V：mileson0718", "facets": []}, "location": "", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/3624906326/1780408710", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2092152764868816896/IcyU8-cQ_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Sun Sep 20 08:20:17 +0000 2015", "protected": false, "website": null, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 13, "reposts": 122, "likes": 628, "bookmarks": 1111, "quotes": 30, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Sat Sep 19 04:32:12 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1789792332, "possibly_sensitive": false, "views": 81139, "is_note_tweet": false, "community_note": null, "lang": "ja", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "source": "Twitter Web App", "article": {"created_at": "2026-09-19T04:32:12.000Z", "modified_at": "2026-09-19T04:51:48.000Z", "id": "2101166175178928128", "title": "Jev 新手终极保姆级教程，一次学会全部概念与使用方法", "preview_text": "这几天超级火🔥的 Jev，我发现很多人都只是看热闹，不知道怎么参与进去，包括我自己。所以我详细调研、按步骤走进去之后，写成这份教程，希望帮到更多像我一样的小白，把这个判定模型真正用起来。\n先说清楚它是谁。X", "cover_media": {"id": "QXBpTWVkaWE6DAAFCgABHSjXgp3bwAAKAAIAAAAA2A+uVgAA", "media_id": "2101166182162481152", "media_info": {"__typename": "ApiImage", "color_info": {"palette": [{"percentage": 86.49, "rgb": {"blue": 246, "green": 242, "red": 253}}, {"percentage": 6.33, "rgb": {"blue": 113, "green": 103, "red": 109}}, {"percentage": 4.52, "rgb": {"blue": 206, "green": 169, "red": 251}}, {"percentage": 1.85, "rgb": {"blue": 157, "green": 111, "red": 229}}, {"percentage": 0.57, "rgb": {"blue": 127, "green": 159, "red": 179}}]}, "original_img_height": 793, "original_img_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSjXgp3bwAAxX95.jpg", "original_img_width": 1983}, "media_key": "3_2101166182162481152"}, "content": {"blocks": [{"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "uy2tt", "text": "这几天超级火🔥的 Jev，我发现很多人都只是看热闹，不知道怎么参与进去，包括我自己。所以我详细调研、按步骤走进去之后，写成这份教程，希望帮到更多像我一样的小白，把这个判定模型真正用起来。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {"urls": [{"fromIndex": 79, "text": "typesafe.ai", "toIndex": 90}]}, "entityRanges": [{"key": 0, "length": 11, "offset": 79}], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "saxla", "text": "先说清楚它是谁。X 上这个 Jev，跟游戏主播 FaZe Jev 不是一回事。这里说的是 TypeSafe AI 在 2026 年 9 月公开的模型。官网在 typesafe.ai，进去就能排队。它不聊天，不写文案，不写代码，也不陪你讨论人生。你给它一份材料，再给它几道事先写好的题，它只返回结构化答案，以及每个答案的概率。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "li3vx", "text": "官方把它叫 System One Model，第一款公开模型就叫 Jev。你可以把它理解成软件里的判断零件：这封客服信交给谁，这步该点哪个按钮，这封邮件要不要马上回。大模型继续负责写和想，Jev 负责判和分流。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [{"key": 1, "length": 1, "offset": 0}], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "2q1e5", "text": " ", "type": "atomic"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "6pjwb", "text": "如果你打开官网找不到对话框，页面没坏。欢迎页自己写了：Not a generative chat model。找不到聊天框，是正常的。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [{"key": 2, "length": 39, "offset": 33}], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "ks6fw", "text": "官方创始人那条原帖刷得很凶，技术说明在 TypeSafe 博客里：Introducing System One Models &amp; Jev。里面有一句最好懂：把它想成一次带判断力的函数调用，现场材料进去，带类型、带概率的决策出来。名字来自杰文斯悖论，意思是东西变便宜以后，用量往往会不降反升。它快、便宜的代价也写在明面上：Jev 不能生成文字。聊天模型负责写给人看的句子，它负责给程序一个勾选项。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "jnhpu", "text": "System One 可以先记成「快判断」。人做选择题、过闸、分流时，靠的是快判断。写长文、做证明、慢慢想，是另一套慢思考。Jev 站在快判断这一边。所以你在练习场里看不到对话框。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "9fpuc", "text": "界面上会反复跳英文。先看这张对照表，右边才是人话。左边的词，点按钮时再认。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [{"key": 3, "length": 1, "offset": 0}], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "s18x6", "text": " ", "type": "atomic"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "3ke4h", "text": "\n", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [{"key": 4, "length": 1, "offset": 0}], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "24ouq", "text": " ", "type": "atomic"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "ywmsy", "text": "\n", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [{"key": 5, "length": 1, "offset": 0}], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "o0o1b", "text": " ", "type": "atomic"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "5kfxd", "text": "一、先把五个概念立住", "type": "header-two"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [{"length": 6, "offset": 0, "style": "Bold"}], "key": "hud2d", "text": "它是判定器。 ChatGPT 一类模型会先吐一段话，你再从这段话里把「退款」抠出来写进代码。Jev 把顺序倒过来：你先规定答案只能是哪些，它只能从里面选，并告诉你有多有把握。官方那句比较准：材料进去，带类型、带概率的决策出来。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [{"length": 9, "offset": 0, "style": "Bold"}], "key": "eyuts", "text": "一次调用只有三块。 State 是原始材料，一段客服消息或一段 JSON。Questions 是你事先定义的问题，每道题只能是 Noul、Choice、Score 三种之一。Answers 按你起的键名返回。代码读键，别去解析散文。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [{"length": 11, "offset": 0, "style": "Bold"}], "key": "3pio2", "text": "三种题，就是全部题型。 Noul 是是非题，返回 0 到 1 的「是」的概率。Choice 是单选题，你列出选项，它选一个，并给出每个选项的概率。Score 是评分题，你规定有顺序的等级，它按这把尺子打分，分数可以是小数。一次调用可以同时问好几道。真正费时间的，是把「我想知道什么」写成清楚的问题和标准。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [{"key": 6, "length": 1, "offset": 0}], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "0czcf", "text": " ", "type": "atomic"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [{"length": 17, "offset": 0, "style": "Bold"}], "key": "ew72s", "text": "confidence 是集中程度。 0.92 只说明答案比较集中，不保证在你的业务里一定对。官方说的 zero hallucinations，指输出被锁在你规定的类型里。正确用法是拿自己的历史样本盲测，画出自动放行线。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [{"length": 13, "offset": 0, "style": "Bold"}], "key": "4xb5h", "text": "英文更稳，中文能用但要测。 输入目前只吃文字，包括 JSON。图片、语音、视频要先转成文字。中文能跑，口译、繁体、产品黑话都要自己拿真实样本对照。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "j2ep7", "text": "官方可以记的量级：端到端大约 70 到 500 毫秒；输入大约每百万 token 0.042 美元，也就是每十亿输入 42 美元；输出按官方口径不单独计费。单请求上下文大约 64k，其中 state 和最长问题合计大约 32k。这些是厂商和第三方整理出来的数字，会变，以控制台账单为准。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "x9q2z", "text": "二、申请到第一次跑通", "type": "header-two"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "wx4bc", "text": "不要一上来接仓库。按这五步走，卡在哪一步就停在哪一步。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [{"key": 7, "length": 1, "offset": 0}], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "qmkxd", "text": " ", "type": "atomic"}, {"data": {"urls": [{"fromIndex": 3, "text": "typesafe.ai", "toIndex": 14}, {"fromIndex": 33, "text": "console.typesafe.ai", "toIndex": 52}, {"fromIndex": 57, "text": "docs.typesafe.ai", "toIndex": 73}]}, "entityRanges": [{"key": 8, "length": 11, "offset": 3}, {"key": 9, "length": 19, "offset": 33}, {"key": 10, "length": 16, "offset": 57}], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "4t7cr", "text": "打开 typesafe.ai 加入 Waitlist。通过后登录 console.typesafe.ai。文档在 docs.typesafe.ai。X 上有人几十分钟到一天能过，也有人更久。别改十个邮箱硬刷。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "7kyl3", "text": "申请时把两句话写具体：我在做什么，打算用 Jev 做什么。比如你在做独立开发者工具，想给工单做付款、技术、其他分流。这比只写「研究 AI」好过。有人碰到最后一题问最爱的 meme，按实写就行。愿意把用途写清楚的，社区反馈通过更快。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "86o7e", "text": "通过后不是一个对话框，是一个工作台。左侧常见 Home、Playground、Usage、API Keys、Documentation。首页右侧能复制 Agent Prompt，能看到 Key 入口和用量。用量统计可能延迟十几分钟，刚跑完别以为没扣。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [{"key": 11, "length": 1, "offset": 0}], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "uksci", "text": " ", "type": "atomic"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "1hi5l", "text": "很多人一进账单区会愣：我没绑卡，为什么能用？社区截图比较一致，通过后常见赠送 5 美元。充值点 Add funds。自动续费要先把卡加上。5 美元按官方单价够你把 Playground 和第一段代码跑熟。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [{"key": 12, "length": 1, "offset": 0}], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "vfwxt", "text": " ", "type": "atomic"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "64wco", "text": "打开练习场 Playground。左边贴现场材料 State，右边写试卷 Questions，点开始判定 Run。练习材料用这条，不泄密：", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "islhe", "text": "「我的月订阅被扣了两次款。可以帮我核对这两笔付款吗？」", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "dr1nn", "text": "同时写三道题。Noul：这条消息是否催促马上处理。Choice：这条消息属于哪一类，选项写成付款、功能故障、使用帮助、功能建议、正向反馈、其他。Score：客户不耐烦的程度，按你自己写死的三到五档。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "5m52b", "text": "点 Run。你要看的不是一段解释，是它选了哪一项，每项概率多少，confidence 是多少。高把握可以考虑自动过，中间档交给大模型，低把握转人工。有人用大约 80% 当自动放行线，那是别人的线。你要用自己的旧数据画。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "ox477", "text": "三、Questions 怎么写", "type": "header-two"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "qn5up", "text": "这是最容易卡死的一步。社区有一张中文上手图，把键名、类型、选项和返回值画在一起了，建议对着看。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [{"key": 13, "length": 1, "offset": 0}], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "kk8h5", "text": " ", "type": "atomic"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "8x2qf", "text": "State 只放判断需要的材料。客服原话、已经发生的事实。别把整本公司制度贴进去。每道题先写人话，再选类型。人话写不清，换类型也救不了。Choice 的选项必须互斥。别同时出现「售后」和「退货」，除非你能用一句话讲清差别。Score 的 criteria 用数组，从低到高。Noul 通常不需要 criteria。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "jewwg", "text": "一个能直接改的骨架：", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "me6x8", "text": "{\n  \"is_urgent\": {\n    \"type\": \"noul\",\n    \"instructions\": \"这条消息是否表达必须马上处理？\"\n  },\n  \"department\": {\n    \"type\": \"choice\",\n    \"instructions\": \"应该由哪个团队处理？\",\n    \"criteria\": {\n      \"billing\": \"付款、扣费、退款、对账\",\n      \"technical\": \"故障、连不上、集成报错\",\n      \"sales\": \"价格、套餐、新签约\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"frustration\": {\n    \"type\": \"score\",\n    \"instructions\": \"客户表现得有多沮丧？\",\n    \"criteria\": [\n      \"冷静，只是在陈述事实\",\n      \"不满，但还保持礼貌\",\n      \"非常愤怒，使用强烈措辞\"\n    ]\n  }\n}", "type": "blockquote"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "wh5qj", "text": "键名自己起，返回答案会沿着这些键回来。用英文下划线，后面好写代码。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "cqpz6", "text": "四、能做什么，暂时别做什么", "type": "header-two"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "76jjr", "text": "适合它的，都是答案集合事先想得清的事。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [{"key": 14, "length": 1, "offset": 0}], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "6gyct", "text": " ", "type": "atomic"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "7n6a6", "text": "常见几类：客服分流，内容初审，邮件是否紧急，Agent 在有限动作里选下一步，浏览器一堆按钮里点哪一个，高把握自动过、低把握再问大模型。社区里还有邮箱归类、交易邮件记税前分类、内容审核接口这类玩法。共同点是选项事先存在，不需要它写一篇话。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "ndhii", "text": "写文案、写代码、开放问答、解释为什么、陪聊、直接看图看视频，这些它接不住。你业务里如果没有任何一次调用其实只是让模型返回一个选项，可以先观察，不必追。有这样的调用，再拿真实历史数据测 70% 到 90% 那一档，过了再从高阈值往下加闸门。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "7h3as", "text": "一个能落地的分流规则，只作起点：confidence 大于 0.9，代码自动执行；0.7 到 0.9，交给大模型复核；低于 0.7，转人工。阈值必须用你自己的样本校准。退款、删数据、对外发消息，即使把握很高，第一周也建议人工盯。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "r822e", "text": "五、第一段可以落地的代码", "type": "header-two"}, {"data": {"urls": [{"fromIndex": 33, "text": "https://api.typesafe.ai/v1/systemone", "toIndex": 69}]}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "pzjkv", "text": "Playground 跑通以后，再碰 API。请求打到 POST https://api.typesafe.ai/v1/systemone。Header 带 Authorization: Bearer 你的KEY，以及 Content-Type: application/json。模型名常用 jev-latest，也见过 jev-1.13.0，以当时文档为准。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [{"key": 15, "length": 1, "offset": 0}], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "29ybs", "text": " ", "type": "atomic"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "n14j8", "text": "先把 Key 放到环境变量 TYPESAFE_API_KEY，不要写进仓库。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {"urls": [{"fromIndex": 25, "text": "https://api.typesafe.ai/v1/systemone", "toIndex": 61}]}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "kzntz", "text": "const res = await fetch(\"https://api.typesafe.ai/v1/systemone\", {\n  method: \"POST\",\n  headers: {\n    Authorization: Bearer ${process.env.TYPESAFE_API_KEY},\n    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n  },\n  body: JSON.stringify({\n    model: \"jev-latest\",\n    state: \"我的月订阅被扣了两次款。可以帮我核对这两笔付款吗？\",\n    questions: {\n      is_urgent: {\n        type: \"noul\",\n        instructions: \"这条消息是否催促马上处理？\",\n      },\n      department: {\n        type: \"choice\",\n        instructions: \"应该由哪个团队处理？\",\n        criteria: {\n          billing: \"付款、扣费、退款、对账\",\n          technical: \"故障、连不上、集成报错\",\n          sales: \"价格、套餐、新签约\",\n        },\n      },\n      frustration: {\n        type: \"score\",\n        instructions: \"客户有多沮丧？\",\n        criteria: [\"冷静陈述\", \"不满但礼貌\", \"非常愤怒\"],\n      },\n    },\n  }),\n});", "type": "blockquote"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "hdvhv", "text": "const data = await res.json();\nconsole.log(data.answers);", "type": "blockquote"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "vpzoi", "text": "返回里读 answers。is_urgent.noul 是 0 到 1，department.choice 是选中的键，department.probabilities 是每个选项的概率，department.confidence 是这道题的集中程度，frustration.score 是分数。判定之后的动作由你的 if 来写。Jev 不会替你执行业务。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "baecx", "text": "想让 Agent 来调，社区常见四步：官网申请；在 Codex 或 Claude Code 里安装 TypeSafe Skill；控制台建 Key；提示词里写 Use the TypeSafe skill。安装命令以控制台首页 Quickstart 当时显示的为准，常见写法是 npx skills add typesafe-ai/skills --skill typesafe-ai。那是第二天的事。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "4flui", "text": "六、建议按这个顺序练", "type": "header-two"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "64shm", "text": "用「扣了两次款」那条，在 Playground 同时跑三道题，截图留下。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "3j2s9", "text": "把选项「配送」和「退换货」故意写重叠，再跑一遍，看它怎么飘。改到互斥，再跑。你会体会到试卷比模型名重要。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "fggsz", "text": "准备 30 条自己的旧消息，人工先标好该谁处理。用同一套 Questions 盲测。统计高把握里错了几条，低把握里对了几条，画出你的自动放行线。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "ojcnm", "text": "把同一批中文样本，题干改成英文再跑，记下差别。以后中文业务至少抽测。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "vi4zy", "text": "把第一段代码跑通，打印 answers，不要打印整段散文。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "72ydz", "text": "这五步做完，你就不是在收藏刷屏。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "23tfj", "text": "七、Playground 怎么读结果", "type": "header-two"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "g07oi", "text": "左边 State 就当现场。你是客服主管，手里只有客户刚发来的那几句话。Jev 不会上网查订单，也不会猜这人是不是 VIP。你没写进 State 的，它就没有。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "xylet", "text": "右边 Questions 就当试卷。试卷必须在开考前印好。现场再改选项，叫重新出题。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "rjqnu", "text": "点 Run 之后按这个顺序读。第一眼看它选了哪个键。第二眼看第二名差多少，billing 56%、technical 44%，这叫纠结。第三眼看 confidence，低把握时即使第一名看起来对，也不该自动执行。第四眼看三道题有没有打架，比如 Noul 说不紧急，Score 却打到非常愤怒。打架时优先检查 State 是不是太短。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "p5zwg", "text": "同一条材料至少跑两次。第一次用中文题干，第二次把 instructions 和 criteria 改成英文，State 仍用中文。把两次答案记在表里。这张表比评测博主的截图更接近你的业务。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "y4hmt", "text": "八、三个能对着改的例子", "type": "header-two"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "mzpmk", "text": "客服工单。State 用扣款那条。问紧急、问部门、问情绪。department 是 billing 且 is_urgent 高于 0.75，进加急对账；department 是 technical，进故障队列；frustration 落在最高档，无论部门是什么，都抄送人工主管。情绪高不等于该退款，只等于该有人出面。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "5oib5", "text": "内容初审。State 是即将发出的帖子正文。Noul 问是否包含明显辱骂。Choice 写成放行、需人工、直接拒绝。Score 打品牌风险。Noul 很低且 Choice 是放行且 Score 低，才自动发。任何一项踩线，进人工。不要让它直接按发布。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "wny0z", "text": "Agent 选下一步。State 是当前任务描述加已经试过的步骤。Choice 写成继续当前模型、换成更强模型、停下来问人、改去检索文档。Noul 问是否已经具备足够信息可以给结论。选项必须是动作。别写成「思考一下」「再试试」。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "sivvp", "text": "九、用 30 条旧数据画放行线", "type": "header-two"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [{"key": 16, "length": 1, "offset": 0}], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "3ma3k", "text": " ", "type": "atomic"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "7au0x", "text": "准备一个表格，四列：原始文本、你人工标的部门、Jev 选的部门、confidence。找 30 条真实旧消息，不要现编。现编太干净，看起来会假准。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "6tbeq", "text": "全部跑完后，先别看总准确率。先切两刀。只看 confidence 大于 0.85 的那些行，12 条里错 0 条，这条线可以当自动分流候选；12 条里错 3 条，线太松，提到 0.92 再看。再只看低于 0.6 的那些行，对错各半，说明它在说自己不知道，这是健康的。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "nchu4", "text": "单独看中文黑话行。订单号、内部套餐名、你们才用的缩写，最容易把 Choice 带偏。解决办法是把这些词写进 criteria 的解释里，或在 State 前加一行说明。它不读你公司维基，除非你塞进这一次的 State。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "6l334", "text": "30 条仍然很少，但够你决定今天要不要接到正式分流。连 30 条都对不齐，不要接。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "seucp", "text": "十、钱、速度，和你该有的预期", "type": "header-two"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [{"key": 17, "length": 1, "offset": 0}], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "dcga3", "text": " ", "type": "atomic"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "n9mpr", "text": "官方单价按输入算，输出按口径免费。5 美元赠金够把教室作业做完，通常不够把全年生产流量打满。上线前用自己的平均 State 长度乘调用次数估一笔账。别用「193 倍更快」做预算，用「我每条工单大概 800 个 token、一天 2000 条」做预算。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "vqhn3", "text": "单次判定常常明显快过让大模型先写一段再解析。用户感知到的慢，经常不在模型，在你把低把握请求又丢回大模型以后。分流的意义，是让高把握的那一批不再排队。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "47t2n", "text": "社区有人拿它替换压缩摘要，结论是更快，留下的原文更像原文。别指望它变成更聪明的作家，指望它变成更快的打钩人。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "st1bl", "text": "十一、主要的限制", "type": "header-two"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "bk99c", "text": "没写进 State 的订单状态，它不会查。 目前文本为主，麻将牌面、截图里的按钮要先变成字。 你已经能用关键词稳定解决的事，不必强行换它。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "3js1i", "text": " 关键动作要自己落库：谁在何时、用哪套 Questions、得到哪个答案、最后执行了什么。 模型名、单价、赠金、排队策略都可能改。生产环境把模型名写死，把单价做成配置。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "xgc0d", "text": "十二、卡住了按这些排", "type": "header-two"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [{"key": 18, "length": 1, "offset": 0}], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "54hd1", "text": " ", "type": "atomic"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "5pz01", "text": "申请一直不过，把用途写具体。 找不到聊天框，用练习场或接口。 Questions 不会写，先在纸上写三句人话，再标成 Noul、Choice、Score。 中文不准，同一批样本用英文题干对照。 confidence 很高但判错，拿旧数据盲测，别迷信把握。 不知道去哪开通额度，回控制台，通过后常见先有 5 美元。 401，检查 Key 有没有进当前环境。 类型报错，核对 type 只能是 noul、choice、score；Choice 的 criteria 用对象，Score 用数组。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "2uf4h", "text": "什么都分到「其他」，通常是前几个选项写太窄。什么都分到同一个部门，通常是 State 太短，或某个部门的解释吞掉了别的部门。两次跑同一条还跳，先看 Questions 有没有改过，再看 confidence，低把握的跳应转人工。本地可以上线 401，是部署环境没带上 KEY。觉得比大模型还慢，检查是不是判定完又让大模型重新判定了一遍。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "7domm", "text": "十三、FAQ", "type": "header-two"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "1dx9o", "text": "1️⃣ Jev 是 ChatGPT 的平替吗？", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "90mog", "text": "它不聊天。它接的是你业务里「其实只让模型选一个选项」的那一层。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "hgn28", "text": "2️⃣ 必须会写代码吗？", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "219ng", "text": "第一天不必。Playground 就能完成概念和第一条练习。要接业务再写那二十行。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "xlhxh", "text": "3️⃣ 必须会英语吗？", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "2ao80", "text": "界面不少是英文。对照标注图能点下去。题干可以中文，但要抽测。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "un63v", "text": "4️⃣ 在哪里充值？", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "b8qt9", "text": "控制台账单区 Add funds。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "jno12", "text": "5️⃣ Key 存在哪？", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "7rubv", "text": "环境变量或本机密钥库。别发群，别贴 X，别进 Git。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "w7hyt", "text": "6️⃣ 模型名写什么？", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "7qglk", "text": "先写 jev-latest。锁定生产再改成文档里的具体版本号。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "nus35", "text": "7️⃣ 中文能不能用？", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "63r88", "text": "能。英文更稳。上线前用自己的中文样本测。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "gu0ks", "text": "8️⃣ 能不能看图？", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "e2t7j", "text": "图要先转成文字描述或结构化字段。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "14881", "text": "9️⃣ confidence 0.9 能自动退款吗？", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "bvj1", "text": "第一周不要。先自动分流，退款仍人工或规则确认。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "sn6g5", "text": "🔟 一次能问多少题？", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "e595c", "text": "可以一次问多道。同一份 State 能一次问完的，就一次问完。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "ytqs7", "text": "1️⃣0️⃣ criteria 写很长会不会更好？", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "5jbj8", "text": "写清边界即可。把小说写进 criteria，token 更贵，判断未必更稳。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "x3c4s", "text": "1️⃣1️⃣ 返回答案能当文案发给客户吗？", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "7on40", "text": "发给客户的话仍由模板或大模型写。Jev 只决定走哪条模板。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "ur1go", "text": "1️⃣2️⃣ Skill 装上了还不调？", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "aq18g", "text": "提示词里写 Use the TypeSafe skill，并确认 Agent 读得到 Key。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "wgtd9", "text": "1️⃣3️⃣ 能不能替代整个 Agent？", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "431ki", "text": "不能。它重构的是工作流里某个判断节点。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "jknii", "text": "1️⃣4️⃣ 今天该不该 All in？", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "edb12", "text": "先列自己业务里「其实只返回一个选项」的调用。一个都没有，就观察。有，就做 30 条旧数据那一表。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "hfr2a", "text": "1️⃣5️⃣ 产品经理看到哪可以停？", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "5241d", "text": "看到 30 条表。你能独立完成画线，就已经能判断要不要让工程师接。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "eq3ku", "text": "1️⃣6️⃣ 工程师的最小闭环是什么？", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "d4he8", "text": "环境变量、一段 fetch、三道题、把 answers 打进日志、用 30 条回放。别先做平台。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "bcfpf", "text": "十四、上线前勾这些", "type": "header-two"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [{"key": 19, "length": 1, "offset": 0}], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "4vgel", "text": " ", "type": "atomic"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "2ap6h", "text": "Questions 是否互斥，同事不看文档也能选。 State 是否只包含系统里真有的字段。 30 条旧数据是否已经盲测，高把握错误率是否可接受。 ", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "5ipir", "text": "低把握是否有去处。 退款、删除、对外发送是否仍被规则拦住。 Key 是否只在服务器环境变量里。 模型名是否写死，是否记录当时版本。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "78rt6", "text": " 日志是否记下 question 版本号、answers、最终动作。 中文样本是否单独看过。 账单告警是否设置，赠金到期是否有人盯。 有没有一键关闭自动执行、只保留记录的开关。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "w9ovc", "text": "前六项不过，不要接生产。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "wi84u", "text": "十五、怎么嵌进现有业务", "type": "header-two"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [{"key": 20, "length": 1, "offset": 0}], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "ev541", "text": " ", "type": "atomic"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "eyma2", "text": "别新开一个「Jev 中台」。从已经存在的 if 下手。你现在如果已经有一段「标题包含退款就进财务」，先并行：旧规则照跑，Jev 也跑，只记日志，不改路由。跑一周，看两者在哪些样本上打架。打架的那些，才是 Questions 要改的地方。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "093yw", "text": "一周后，只把高把握且与旧规则一致的那部分交给自动走。其余仍走旧规则或人工。这叫双轨。切换是演示词，双轨才能上线。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "u44lu", "text": "跟同事可以这么说。大模型像一个会写字的同事，Jev 像一个只会勾选项的同事。前者贵、慢、话多，适合起草。后者便宜、快、话少，适合过闸。先让会勾选项的人把明确件拿走，再让会写字的人处理含糊件。评审时把 30 条表带上。没有表，先别开会。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "813bk", "text": "十六、去哪里获取", "type": "header-two"}, {"data": {"urls": [{"fromIndex": 7, "text": "typesafe.ai", "toIndex": 18}, {"fromIndex": 52, "text": "console.typesafe.ai", "toIndex": 71}, {"fromIndex": 82, "text": "docs.typesafe.ai", "toIndex": 98}, {"fromIndex": 117, "text": "whatisjev.com/zh-tw", "toIndex": 136}]}, "entityRanges": [{"key": 21, "length": 11, "offset": 7}, {"key": 22, "length": 19, "offset": 52}, {"key": 23, "length": 16, "offset": 82}, {"key": 24, "length": 19, "offset": 117}, {"key": 25, "length": 7, "offset": 158}], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "5bsc7", "text": "排队和产品看 typesafe.ai，进去申请就能开始。 控制台、Key、Playground、账单在 console.typesafe.ai。 字段和最新限制看 docs.typesafe.ai。 想先用普通人的话理解它，可以打开 whatisjev.com/zh-tw。 想看 X 上这两天的长文和演示，可以翻 jev-hub。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "xg1th", "text": "官方数字和社区实测不是同一层东西。厂商说更快更便宜、输出带校准把握。更有用的判断是：它接的是选择题这一层；今天能用的多半是接口，不是成品应用；值钱的是按把握分流。", "type": "unstyled"}, {"data": {}, "entityRanges": [], "inlineStyleRanges": [], "key": "2gq36", "text": "希望本次的教程对你有所帮助 (｡･ω･｡)ﾉ♡，抓紧去玩 Jev 吧～这是一款让人惊叹的全新 AI 大模型，一定会改变你对 AI 的理解！", "type": "unstyled"}], "entityMap": [{"key": "12", "value": {"data": {"entityKey": "8f8e4174-fdbe-4577-9650-771479d186e8", "mediaItems": [{"localMediaId": "7", "mediaCategory": "DraftTweetImage", "mediaId": "2101166124146835456"}]}, "mutability": "Immutable", "type": "MEDIA"}}, {"key": "8", "value": {"data": {"entityKey": "3efe28b9-a4d8-43c7-8337-be5a7110d79c", "url": "https://typesafe.ai/"}, "mutability": "Mutable", "type": "LINK"}}, {"key": "19", "value": {"data": {"entityKey": "a62bdda6-52f5-43b3-b5f2-deccadd6ee68", "mediaItems": [{"localMediaId": "22", "mediaCategory": "DraftTweetImage", "mediaId": "2101172209926717440"}]}, "mutability": "Immutable", "type": "MEDIA"}}, {"key": "23", "value": {"data": {"entityKey": "a3abf954-8677-46fd-9776-8b078bd4686d", "url": "https://docs.typesafe.ai/"}, "mutability": "Mutable", "type": "LINK"}}, {"key": "4", "value": {"data": {"entityKey": "13f1c520-9338-4ddf-85ed-c94d2dd1ed48", "mediaItems": [{"localMediaId": "2", "mediaCategory": "DraftTweetImage", "mediaId": "2101166072225497088"}]}, "mutability": "Immutable", "type": "MEDIA"}}, {"key": "15", "value": {"data": {"entityKey": "b4fdac34-2cad-4852-9473-6f7f53ca799b", "mediaItems": [{"localMediaId": "10", "mediaCategory": "DraftTweetImage", "mediaId": "2101166154933039104"}]}, "mutability": "Immutable", "type": "MEDIA"}}, {"key": "11", "value": {"data": {"entityKey": "4225f453-7431-43